/* Cocaine — Power (triggers, screen off, Shortcuts) — zh-Hans */

"Turn the screen off instead" = "改为关闭屏幕";
"The Mac keeps working with the screen off." = "屏幕关闭时 Mac 继续工作。";
"While Cocaine is on. Any key or click turns the screen back on. The Mac locks as set in Lock Screen settings." = "在 Cocaine 开启时。按任意键或点按即可重新点亮屏幕。Mac 按“锁定屏幕”设置锁定。";
"Now" = "现在";
"Turn the screens off now" = "立即关闭屏幕";
"Power" = "电源";
"On while the Mac is on the charger, or on battery above a level; off 30 seconds after" = "Mac 接通充电器时，或使用电池且电量高于某一水平时开启；30 秒后关闭";
"On the charger" = "接通充电器";
"Down to" = "最低至";
"Below this level the battery trigger lets go" = "低于此电量时电池触发器停止";
"External display" = "外接显示器";
"On while a display is connected (or while none is); off 30 seconds after" = "连接显示器时（或未连接时）开启；30 秒后关闭";
"Not connected" = "未连接";
"Schedule" = "时间表";
"On during these hours on the chosen days; off when they end" = "在所选日期的这些时段开启；结束时关闭";
"Hours" = "时段";
"Ends the next day" = "次日结束";
"Local time; follows daylight saving and time-zone changes" = "本地时间；随夏令时和时区变化";
"Turn on when" = "开启条件";
"Any: one reason is enough. All: every chosen one must hold." = "任一：一个条件即可。全部：所选条件都须满足。";
"All are true" = "全部满足";
"Any is true" = "任一满足";
"Shortcuts app and links" = "“快捷指令”App 和链接";
"Lets the Shortcuts app and cocaine:// links turn Cocaine on and off without asking. Off: Cocaine asks you first." = "允许“快捷指令”App 和 cocaine:// 链接无需询问即可开关 Cocaine。关闭时 Cocaine 会先询问你。";
"Allow Shortcuts and links to control Cocaine?" = "允许“快捷指令”和链接控制 Cocaine 吗？";
"Something opened “%@”. If it wasn't you, choose Don't Allow. You can change this in Automation → Shortcuts." = "有程序打开了“%@”。如果不是你，请选择“不允许”。可在“自动化”→“快捷键”中更改。";
"Don't Allow" = "不允许";
"Too hot with the lid closed: Cocaine is off" = "合盖时过热：Cocaine 已关闭";

/* Display and power: the HUD, Stay available, Monitors */
"Cocaine handles the volume and brightness keys and shows their bar in the island. When the island can't be seen (full screen, settings open), macOS shows its own." = "Cocaine 处理音量和亮度键，并在灵动岛中显示其进度条。灵动岛不可见时（全屏、设置已打开），由 macOS 显示自己的指示。";
"While you're idle it sends an invisible mouse event just before Teams and the like would show you as away. This also keeps the screen saver, the lock and display sleep from starting." = "在你空闲时，于 Teams 等应用将你显示为离开之前发送一个不可见的鼠标事件。这也会阻止屏幕保护程序、锁定和显示器睡眠启动。";
"Monitor %d" = "显示器 %d";
"Not answering over DDC/CI" = "未通过 DDC/CI 响应";
"Controls the monitor itself, over DDC/CI. A value the monitor doesn't report shows –." = "通过 DDC/CI 控制显示器本身。显示器未报告的数值显示为 –。";
